// Entra ID Credentials Added to an Application or Service Principal
// Detects a client secret or certificate being added to an app registration or service principal. A new credential on an already-privileged app gives persistent, MFA-free API access to the tenant.
// techniques: T1098.001   severity: medium   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1098.001
//   az ad app credential reset --id <lab-app-id> --append
// source: rules/persistence/entra-app-credentials-added.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
AuditLogs
| where ((OperationName contains @"Add service principal credentials" or OperationName contains @"Certificates and secrets management"))
